    <string name="export_dialog_body">Standard PDF saves a printable map at an orienteering print scale that fits your route. Optional control legends can be enabled in Settings.\n\nOpen O-map only opens the Oomap website centered on your start. The browser cannot read your route from that link.\n\nUse Share route as GPX to export checkpoints and the walking path. In Oomap, drag the GPX onto the map (see Oomap help: importing controls).</string>
    <string name="export_share_gpx_hint">After sharing, save the GPX where you can open it on the device or computer that runs Oomap.</string>
